<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#reproduction> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-item a frbr:Item ;\n        frbr:reproduction :my-other-item .\n\n    :my-other-item a frbr:Item .\n    " .
